    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say that, but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like if i wasn't here, they could actually breathe. they wouldn't have to walk on eggshells around my mood or spend all their energy trying to keep me afloat. it's like my existence is just a constant tax on their happiness. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... stop being the problem?",
